  "job": "Plants shards of the fallen needle whose shadows slow the enemy, then fall on them.",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "lore": "When the needle fell, it broke into more pieces than anyone has counted, and Hesmi has spent her life carrying them. She keeps no side's hour. She walks the rim with three shards strapped to her back, and wherever she plants one it casts the shadow the needle should have cast, long and dark and pointing away from her. The Hourless say the shards remember the time. Hesmi says they are just heavy. She is slow to speak, slower to anger, and almost impossible to move.",
